<p>Tashnalab duqtare shahe kouno makaa'n,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fugha'n.</p>

<p>Har taraf ab toh chayi hai mayusiya'n,<br>
Raah sooni hai mai dekhti hoon jaha'n,<br>
Ghum ka yaara nahi ab labo par hai jaa'n,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fugha'n.</p>

<p>Karne mushkil kushayi meri aaiye,<br>
Mujhpe nazre karam apne farmaiye,<br>
Zindagi ka hai har lamha ek imtehaa'n,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fugha'n.</p>

<p>Hai bhanwar me safina mera kya karu'n,<br>
Hai kanara bhi mujhse qafa kya karu'n,<br>
Do sahara mujhe mai hu muztar yaha'n,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fugha'n.</p>

<p>Chand saanson ki mohtaj hu aaiye,<br>
Mujhpe aye Shahzadi taras khayiye,<br>
Aap ke dar se uthke mai jaon kaha'n,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fugha'n.</p>

<p>Wasta che(6) mahine ki jaa'n ka tumhe,<br>
Wasta Akbare noujawa'n ka tumhe,<br>
Apni rudaad karti hu tumse Bayaa'n,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fugha'n.</p>

<p>Tum ko zindaan ke tarikiyon ki qasam,<br>
Aur rasan basta Saidaniyon ki qasam,<br>
Kardo mushkil ko asaan aye Sarwar ki jaan,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fughan.</p>

<p>Mujhko sadqa do Karbal ke bimaar ka,<br>
Mujhko sadqa do pyase Alamdar ka,<br>
Aao imdaad ko meri tum ho jahaan,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fughan.</p>

<p>Tumko Zainab ki chadar ka hai wasta,<br>
Wasta tumko bazuye Abbas ka,<br>
Kis tarah haale dil ab karu mai bayaan,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fughan.</p>

<p>Hai 'Sohail' apke dar ka adna ghulam,<br>
Iske banjaye bigde huwe saare kaam,<br>
Raat din iske lab par hai bas yeh fughan,<br>
Aye Sakina suno tute dil ki fughan.</p>